; Regression test for GitHub issue #3320: the sub-directives of an
; `account` directive whose own line ends in a comment act on the account
; named before the comment.  Before the fix, the `alias`, `payee` and
; `default` lines below pointed at accounts named after their whole
; directive lines, comment included, so the postings that rely on them
; went to those misnamed accounts.

account Expenses:Food  ; groceries and restaurants
    alias food
    payee ^KFC$
account Assets  ; what we own
    account Cash	; on hand
        default
!account Liabilities:Card  ; the deprecated prefix
    alias card

2024/01/01 Market
    food    $10.00
    card

2024/01/02 KFC
    Expenses:Unknown    $5.00
    Assets:Cash

2024/01/03 Snack bar
    Expenses:Food    $2.00

test bal --flat
              $-7.00  Assets:Cash
              $17.00  Expenses:Food
             $-10.00  Liabilities:Card
--------------------
                   0
end test
